          "heading": "Fiji women secure inaugural WXV Challenger title after 20-17 victory over Netherlands",
          "body": "The Fiji women's side secured the inaugural World Rugby WXV Global Series Challenger 2026 title following a 20-17 victory over the Netherlands in Hong Kong. A decisive kick in the 80th minute confirmed the win for Fijiana, who led 12-7 at half-time after tries from Merewairita Neivosa and Ivamere Nabura Rokowati. Despite severe heat delays that cancelled other tournament fixtures, Fiji finished top of the standings ahead of the Dutch and Spain, marking a significant achievement for the national women's programme."
