          "heading": "Ireland women secure consecutive victories over Japan with seven tries",
          "body": "The Ireland women's side secured a comprehensive 43-19 win over Japan in their Test match at Virgin Media Park in Cork on Saturday, scoring seven tries to claim consecutive victories following their previous win in Galway. Scott Bemand's side recovered from conceding an early try to build a 22-7 half-time advantage before extending their lead in the second period, with debuts off the bench marked by tries from Alana McInerney and Sophie Barrett as confidence grows ahead of their upcoming WXV fixtures in South Africa."
