          "body": "The Dragons secured a 36-26 victory over the Scarlets in a high-scoring United Rugby Championship encounter at Rodney Parade. Elliot Dee led the hosts with a brace as the Dragons outscored their rivals by six tries to four, with Anzelo Tuitavuki, Rodrigo Martinez, Huw Anderson and Robert Hunt also crossing. Macs Page scored twice for the Scarlets alongside tries from Sam O'Connor and Ioan Jones, while Scarlets captain Josh Macleod received a yellow card in the 68th minute."
