          "body": "Former Wallabies winger Digby Ioane has expressed optimism regarding the men's national team's current form under head coach Les Kiss, highlighting the coach's supportive culture. Australia enters the upcoming Bledisloe Cup series on a six-Test unbeaten run, following a 42-38 victory over South Africa in Perth. Ioane praised Kiss as a player's coach who cares for the squad's wellbeing both on and off the pitch during his media appearances."
