          "heading": "Japan women's team suffer comprehensive forty-three to nineteen defeat against Ireland",
          "body": "The Japan women's national rugby team fell to a 43-19 defeat against Ireland at Virgin Media Park in Cork on Saturday. Toshizumi Kitagawa's side struggled early as Ireland crossed the whitewash four times in the first half to establish a 22-7 advantage at the break. Despite tries from Sakurako Korai, Nami Asari and Nijiho Nagata, the visitors were unable to halt the hosts, who secured seven tries in total to wrap up consecutive wins in the series."
